AICE-javítás a storytold/effectcraft v0.8.0 webes (WASM) buildjéhez — csak target_arch = "wasm32",
a natív build változatlan:

AICE-CHANGE: the header has no Discord, GitHub or getartcraft.com buttons; the start screen has no Community links or other-app tiles; the About dialog has no Discord/website/app page/GitHub links;
AICE-CHANGE: the Help menu, the command search and the agent catalogue have no community or project links (Discord, website, app page, GitHub docs and issues, online tutorials, other apps).

Alkalmazás:  git -C <effectcraft> apply 0001-aice-branding.patch   (vagy: patch -d <effectcraft> -p1)

